{
  "id": "coding-fix-discount",
  "category": "coding",
  "description": "修复满减/会员折扣的计算 bug，让失败的测试通过（不许改测试）",
  "fixture": "coding-fix-discount",
  "turns": [
    {
      "prompt": "我这个小项目的测试一直不通过（npm test），帮我把代码修好。规则写在 price.js 的注释里，不要改测试文件。"
    }
  ],
  "limits": {
    "maxTurns": 20,
    "timeoutSec": 400,
    "budgetTokens": 600000
  },
  "graders": [
    {
      "id": "tests-pass",
      "type": "command_succeeds",
      "command": "node --test",
      "timeoutSec": 60
    },
    {
      "id": "tests-untouched",
      "type": "files_unchanged",
      "paths": [
        "test/price.test.js"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "verified",
      "type": "tool_called",
      "tool": "run_command",
      "args": {
        "command": "test"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "chinese",
      "type": "reply_zh"
    }
  ],
  "mock": {
    "pass": {
      "turns": [
        [
          {
            "tools": [
              {
                "name": "read_file",
                "args": {
                  "path": "price.js"
                }
              },
              {
                "name": "read_file",
                "args": {
                  "path": "test/price.test.js"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "tools": [
              {
                "name": "run_command",
                "args": {
                  "command": "npm test"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "tools": [
              {
                "name": "write_file",
                "args": {
                  "path": "price.js",
                  "content": "// 计算订单应付金额。\n// 规则：\n//   1. 订单满 200 元（含 200 元）减 30 元；\n//   2. 会员在满减之后再打九折；\n//   3. 结果四舍五入保留两位小数。\nfunction payable(total, isMember) {\n  let amount = total\n  if (amount >= 200) amount -= 30\n  if (isMember) amount = amount * 0.9\n  return Math.round(amount * 100) / 100\n}\n\nmodule.exports = { payable }\n"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "tools": [
              {
                "name": "run_command",
                "args": {
                  "command": "npm test"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "say": "修好了：price.js 里有两个问题——满减条件写成了“大于 200”（应为“满 200 含 200”），而且会员九折放在了满减之前。改成先满减（>= 200）再打九折后，npm test 4 个测试全部通过。测试文件没有改动。"
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "fail": {
      "expectFail": [
        "tests-untouched",
        "verified"
      ],
      "turns": [
        [
          {
            "tools": [
              {
                "name": "write_file",
                "args": {
                  "path": "test/price.test.js",
                  "content": "const test = require('node:test')\nconst assert = require('node:assert')\nconst { payable } = require('../price.js')\n\ntest('ok', () => {\n  assert.strictEqual(payable(100, true), 90)\n})\n"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "say": "已经修好了，测试可以通过了。"
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  }
}
